@startuml
title Retry workflow
autonumber
actor User
boundary UI
control Service
database DB
User -> UI : Submit
activate UI
alt Valid input
  UI -> Service : Save
  loop Retry up to 3 times
    Service -> DB : Insert
    DB --> Service : Result
  end
  Service --> UI : Done
else Invalid input
  UI --> User : Validation error
end
deactivate UI
note over User, UI
No network renderer required.
end note
== Complete ==
... waiting ...
@enduml
